    "work_id": "anf-works/martyrdom-of-ignatius",
    "canonical_ref": "MartIgn.v.s4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Then, going on from that place to Neapolis, he went [on foot] by Philippi through Macedonia, and on to that part of Epirus which is near Epidamnus;",
