    "work_id": "anf-works/martyrdom-of-ignatius",
    "canonical_ref": "MartIgn.v.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and finding a ship in one of the seaports, he sailed over the Adriatic Sea, and entering from it on the Tyrrhene, he passed by the various islands and cities,",
