    "work_id": "anf-works/martyrdom-of-ignatius",
    "canonical_ref": "MartIgn.v.s9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But to him this happened just as he wished, since he was in haste as soon as possible to leave this world, that he might attain to the Lord whom he loved.",
