    "work_id": "anf-works/martyrdom-of-ignatius",
    "canonical_ref": "MartIgn.vi.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "They pushed forth therefore from the place which is called Portus; and (the fame of all relating to the holy martyr being already spread abroad) we met the brethren full of fear and joy;",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
