    "work_id": "anf-works/martyrdom-of-ignatius",
    "canonical_ref": "MartIgn.vi.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "and having persuaded them not to envy him hastening to the Lord, he then, after he had, with all the brethren kneeling [beside him], entreated the Son of God in behalf of the Churches,",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "context_before": null,
