    "work_id": "anf-works/martyrdom-of-ignatius",
    "canonical_ref": "MartIgn.vi.s9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "that so by them the desire of the holy martyr Ignatius should be fulfilled, according to that which is written, “The desire of the righteous is acceptable [to God],”",
