    "work_id": "anf-works/martyrdom-of-ignatius",
    "canonical_ref": "MartIgn.vi.s10",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "to the effect that he might not be troublesome to any of the brethren by the gathering of his remains, even as he had in his Epistle expressed a wish beforehand that so his end might be.",
